<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14003] OOM on creating rebalance iterator while rebalancing cache with large values.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14003</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scenario&lt;br/&gt;
1. Start replicated cache on ignite node, memory region approx 6 Gb, heap 1Gb&lt;br/&gt;
2. Load significant amount of data to cache with values approx 200Kb (~20K kv pairs)&lt;br/&gt;
3. Start another node &lt;br/&gt;
First node (supplier) will crash while initializing rebalance iterator with OOM&lt;br/&gt;
Main reason &amp;#8211; all values, to whon pointed from leaf of BTree, are all loaded to buffer in BPlusTree#ForwardCursor. For replicated cache, 512 iterators for each partition are created at once.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer is attached, run it with &lt;b&gt;-Xmx1G&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
